OL,3,GNEWSAA38 closed after multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A38 in Derbyshire is closed
OL,7,Ffollowing a collision involving
OL,8,Fmultiple vehicles.
OL,10,FPolice said the southbound carriageway
OL,11,Fof the A38 between Coxbench and Little
OL,12,FEaton was closed, in a Facebook post on
OL,13,FMonday morning.
OL,15,FTraffic officers Derbyshire Fire and
OL,16,FRescue Service and East Midlands
OL,17,FAmbulance Service also attended the
OL,18,Fscene, according to National Highways.
OL,20,FThe force said the road would remain
OL,21,Fclosed for "some time" and urged
OL,22,Fdrivers to avoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
